  "2026-10-21T18:00:17.443Z",codex-agent,"Complete CI at executable/test commit 56e28544c28158f36654fb3f0ce58f300e96ef86 passes all required release gates: npm run release:check on Node 22 and Node 26 and bun run release:check on Node 26/Bun 1.3.14 each pass 685/685 with zero failures/skips/cancellations/todos. All three independently measure all 48 authored sources at statements/lines/branches/functions 100/100/100/100, document 339 declarations, and pass strict tracker health, identity audit, zero duplication, zero production vulnerabilities, publish attestation, packed contents, changelog and Bun install. CodeQL passes. Receipt: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-rl/actions/runs/39645374144 . Behavioural revert exact command: node --test --test-name-pattern=\\u0027corpus.output|corpus.exclusive\\u0027 test/corpus.test.ts (0 passed/3 failed with only buildCorpusCommand reverted; restored linked acceptance 3/3; full Git-free corpus acceptance 9/9). The local duplicate npm gate is superseded by these complete CI results; its long learner and checkpoint benchmark passed without a timeout, and it is being stopped after its current Compose file performs normal cleanup. It is not a completed local full-gate receipt. Out-of-scope retained-artifact lint traversal is tracked in open follow-up pm-rl-lintruntime; no lint scope or coverage/statistical threshold was changed. Latest reviewed CodeRabbit body has no outside-diff or nitpick findings. Other automated reviews are unavailable/skipped, so no reviewer approval is inferred. Threads remain untouched; no merge or release."
